Error [jet.InvalidRoute]: HTTP route method `joke` needs read-only self and a concrete signature
  --> tests/ui/http_route_mutable_self.jet:6:5
    |
  6 |     #Server.Get("/jokes")
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Mounted handlers retain shared state and are called on request workers
 Fix: Write `joke: fn(self, ...)` without method type parameters; use Shared<T> for mutable shared state
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2805
